From 08212e93bc098442feb3285f18100af9e9230dc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TUR experiment <tur-experiment@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:06:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] wdfldr.sys: Add a Kernel-Mode Driver Framework loader.

Every KMDF driver imports WdfVersionBind from WDFLDR.SYS and fails to load
without it (bug 56228). Implement the loader interface: load the framework
library service Wdf01000 with ZwLoadDriver, accept its WdfRegisterLibrary,
and register clients with it. The framework library itself is not part of
Wine.
